From b12086a0cf87fc568ecc9b531f9b3f09219e3156 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenUUYC Linux WIP <linux-port@local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:18:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(linux): initial controller compile path for native
 Linux

Gate Windows-only UI/decode/clipboard/plugins behind cfg, add Linux stubs
and portable paths/NetEq/build support so cargo check/build succeed. CLI
native-status, contracts, and rtc-selftest run; GUI/viewer still TODO.
Document blockers in LINUX.md.
